{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56533","headline":"还丹歌 二 · 杨行真人","name":"还丹歌 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹田水结黄芽起，百日养来伏火矣。\n阴居阳鼎是金丹，十月养之堪服饵。\n服饵由来驻颜色，容鬓不衰定心力。\n卖丹卖药住人间，寿命千年人不识。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨行真人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}